' Two humans, no machine players, both from New Sandez. Anna camps a man
' at Bearwoods; Bob comes after her, fights her man until he falls — the
' place is nobody's, its rooms emptied and restocked — and leaves his own.
' Run with `menu seed 7 start 0 start2 0 savefile <f>`.
menuclick 160,100        ' the intro: a click goes to the start screen (IntroScene.cs:135-139)
menuclick 161,165        ' MODE: Original
menuclick 206,165        ' AI: none
menuclick 60,104
type Anna
menuclick 250,104
type Bob
menuclick 163,54         ' START
wait 3
' Day 1. Anna hires and sets out for Bearwoods.
mapclick 75,303
clickon 248
hire
wait 20
esc
mapclick 61,355
' Bob hires another and sets out after her.
mapclick 75,303
clickon 63
hire
wait 20
esc
mapclick 61,355
' Day 3. Anna: in, water for both, her man stays; she waits in the place.
mapclick 61,355
wait 120
mapclick 500,233
wait 20
esc
wait 30
join
day
' Bob: in, and at her man.
mapclick 61,355
wait 60
fight
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
clickon 248
save                     ' the cut: Bob's turn, the place just taken
wait 20
join                     ' Bob's man stays: Bearwoods is his
day                      ' Bob's NEXT
day                      ' Anna's NEXT, day 4
save                     ' Bob's turn, day 4
